{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 39, "ref": "1-kings 20:39", "book": "1-kings", "lang": "ln", "chapter": 20, "translation": "Mpe ntango mokonzi azalaki koleka, ye atunjaki mokonzi, mpe alobaki: Mosali na yo abwamaki na kati ya etumba; mpe tala, ⟨את⟩ moto avokatelaki, mpe moto amemaki epai ya ngai, mpe alobaki: Batela ⟨את⟩ moto oyo; soki abungamamaki ⟨ye⟩ mpe abungami, bomoi na yo ekokanaka na esika ya bomoi na ye, to okofula talanta ya fins.", "tokens": [{"surface": "ויהי", "gloss": "Mpe ntango"}, {"surface": "המלך", "gloss": "mokonzi"}, {"surface": "עבר", "gloss": "azalaki koleka"}, {"surface": "והוא", "gloss": "ye"}, {"surface": "צעק", "gloss": "atunjaki"}, {"surface": "אל", "gloss": "mokonzi"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "mpe alobaki"}, {"surface": "עבדך", "gloss": "Mosali na yo"}, {"surface": "יצא", "gloss": "abwamaki"}, {"surface": "בקרב", "gloss": "na kati ya"}, {"surface": "המלחמה", "gloss": "etumba"}, {"surface": "והנה", "gloss": "mpe tala"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "moto"}, {"surface": "סר", "gloss": "avokatelaki"}, {"surface": "ויבא", "gloss": "mpe amemaki"}, {"surface": "אלי", "gloss": "epai ya ngai"}, {"surface": "איש", "gloss": "moto"}, {"surface": "ויאמר", "gloss": "mpe alobaki"}, {"surface": "שמר", "gloss": "Batela"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "moto oyo"}, {"surface": "האיש", "gloss": "⟨את⟩ moto"}, {"surface": "הזה", "gloss": "oyo"}, {"surface": "אם", "gloss": "soki"}, {"surface": "הפקד", "gloss": "abungamamaki"}, {"surface": "יפקד", "gloss": "abungami"}, {"surface": "והיתה", "gloss": "ekokanaka"}, {"surface": "נפשך", "gloss": "bomoi na yo"}, {"surface": "תחת", "gloss": "na esika ya"}, {"surface": "נפשו", "gloss": "bomoi na ye"}, {"surface": "או", "gloss": "to"}, {"surface": "ככר", "gloss": "talanta"}, {"surface": "כסף", "gloss": "ya fins"}, {"surface": "תשקול", "gloss": "okofula"}], "timestamp": "2026-09-03T18:56:06.194191778Z", "model": "glm-5.3"}